OL,3,GNEWSAVehicle fire leads to rush hour
OL,4,Adelays on M6
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists are facing long delays during
OL,7,Fthe morning rush hour due to a vehicle
OL,8,Ffire on a motorway in Cheshire.
OL,10,FThe incident happened on the M6
OL,11,Fsouthbound at J21A M62 J10 Croft
OL,12,FInterchange.
OL,14,FTraffic monitoring service Inrix is
OL,15,Freporting congestion back to junction
OL,16,F24 Ashton-in-Makerfield.
OL,18,FAll lanes have been reopened.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
